# 依賴 / Dependencies
/node_modules

# 建置產物 / Build output
/dist
/.vite
/coverage

# 環境變數（憑證永不進 repo）/ Environment variables (credentials never enter the repo)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# 本機開發資料庫（`npm run dev` 用的 SQLite 檔）/ The local development database
# 除了 `.db` 本身，也要忽略 WAL 模式的兩個附屬檔（`-wal`／`-shm`）—— 它們是執行期的產物，而且
# 少了它們資料庫可能是不完整的，所以不能只忽略 `*.db` 而留下孤兒的 `-wal`。
# Besides the `.db` itself this covers the two WAL side files (`-wal` / `-shm`): they are runtime
# artefacts, and since a database can be incomplete without them, ignoring only `*.db` would leave
# orphans behind.
/.mysql/

# 日誌 / Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# 編輯器與作業系統 / Editor and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# 工作文件（永不進 repo）/ Work documents (must never enter the repo)
/plan.md
/agent-readme.md
/design.md
/.workbuddy
